<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Plywood declares 1st H1 results.</title>
<headline>Pacific Plywood declares 1st H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	   1.26</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)    nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    11.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		     52.60</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pacific Plywood Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 7-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 25</p>
<p>NOTE - A Malaysia-based plywood manufacturer, listed in Hong Kong on November 20, 1995.</p>
<p>The company proposed a 1-for-10 bonus share issue.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
